/strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yellow</strong> Quartz \u2192 <strong>Glide</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824680/extras/48d2fff4ab0d53029353b9dc50baddbb.poster.avif?t=1769137824\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824680/extras/48d2fff4ab0d53029353b9dc50baddbb.webm?t=1769137824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824680/extras/48d2fff4ab0d53029353b9dc50baddbb.mp4?t=1769137824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine their abilities with shifting platforms to forge your path through intricate rooms filled with deadly traps. True mastery lies not in one crystal, but in the dance of them all together.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World of Precision and Challenge</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Quartz to unlock and master, each with distinct mechanics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ handcrafted rooms of tight, precision platforming.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ thematic worlds, each tied to the game\u2019s evolving narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ post-game trials, designed for those who dare to go beyond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, complex story with charismatic characters who guide, tease, and challenge you as reality itself unravels.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Tasty